<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>AURA Health — AI Healthcare Command Center | Product Design Case Study</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,300;9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --navy:#0A1628;
  --navy-soft:#0F2038;
  --primary:#1B4B91;
  --electric:#3D7FFF;
  --mint:#14B8A6;
  --white:#FFFFFF;
  --bg:#F5F7FB;
  --bg-alt:#EEF2F8;
  --gray:#8894A6;
  --gray-dark:#4A5568;
  --border:#E2E7F0;
  --success:#16A34A;
  --success-bg:#E7F8EE;
  --warning:#D97706;
  --warning-bg:#FDF3E3;
  --critical:#DC2626;
  --critical-bg:#FBEAEA;
  --radius:16px;
  --shadow-sm:0 2px 8px rgba(10,22,40,0.06);
  --shadow-md:0 12px 32px rgba(10,22,40,0.10);
  --shadow-lg:0 30px 80px rgba(10,22,40,0.18);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
body{
  font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--navy);
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
.mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;}
.display{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.01em;}
img{max-width:100%;display:block;}

#progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--electric),var(--mint));z-index:999;width:0%;transition:width .1s linear;}

.section{max-width:1360px;margin:0 auto;padding:130px 60px;}
.section--tight{padding:90px 60px;}
.section--dark{background:var(--navy);color:#EAF0FF;max-width:none;}
.section--alt{background:var(--bg-alt);max-width:none;}
.section--alt > .inner, .section--dark > .inner{max-width:1360px;margin:0 auto;padding:130px 60px;}

.eyebrow{
  font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
  font-size:12px;
  letter-spacing:0.14em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--electric);
  font-weight:600;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  margin-bottom:22px;
}
.eyebrow::before{content:"";width:22px;height:1px;background:var(--electric);display:inline-block;}
.section--dark .eyebrow{color:var(--mint);}
.section--dark .eyebrow::before{background:var(--mint);}

h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;letter-spacing:-0.015em;line-height:1.05;}
p{line-height:1.7;color:var(--gray-dark);font-size:16.5px;}
.section--dark p{color:#A9B8D4;}

/* ---------- HERO ---------- */
.hero{
  background:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 15% 0%,#122747 0%, var(--navy) 55%), var(--navy);
  color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.hero::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
  background-image:radial-gradient(1px 1px at 20% 30%, rgba(255,255,255,.15) 1px, transparent 1px),
    radial-gradient(1px 1px at 70% 60%, rgba(255,255,255,.1) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size:180px 180px;
  pointer-events:none;
}
.hero-inner{max-width:1360px;margin:0 auto;padding:120px 60px 0;position:relative;z-index:1;}
.hero .eyebrow{color:var(--mint);}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(56px,9vw,128px);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;}
.hero .subtitle{font-size:clamp(20px,2.6vw,30px);font-weight:400;color:#B9C7E4;font-family:'Inter';margin-bottom:34px;letter-spacing:0.01em;}
.hero .desc{max-width:640px;font-size:19px;color:#C7D3EA;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:48px;}
.hero-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-bottom:80px;}
.hero-tag{
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
  padding:9px 18px;border-radius:100px;
  font-size:13px;color:#DCE5F7;
  font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
  letter-spacing:0.02em;
}
.hero-mockup-wrap{padding:0 40px;position:relative;z-index:1;}

/* pulse divider */
.pulse{width:100%;height:64px;display:block;}
.pulse path{fill:none;stroke:var(--electric);stroke-width:1.5;opacity:.55;}
.section--dark .pulse path{stroke:var(--mint);}

/* ---------- browser frame ---------- */
.browser-frame{
  background:#fff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);
  border:1px solid rgba(10,22,40,0.06);
}
.browser-bar{
  height:44px;background:#F0F2F6;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 16px;gap:8px;
  border-bottom:1px solid #E4E8EF;
}
.browser-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;}
.browser-url{
  margin-left:16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4E8EF;border-radius:8px;
  padding:6px 14px;font-size:12px;color:#8894A6;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
  flex:1;max-width:340px;
}
.mockup-caption{margin-top:36px;max-width:640px;}
.mockup-caption .label{
  font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--electric);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px;display:block;
}

/* ---------- app shell reused inside mockups ---------- */
.app-shell{display:flex;min-height:640px;background:var(--bg);}
.app-sidebar{
  width:216px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:26px 18px;flex-shrink:0;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px;
}
.app-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:'Fraunces';font-size:20px;font-weight:600;padding:0 6px;}
.app-logo .dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mint);box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--mint);}
.app-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;}
.app-nav-item{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:9px;
  font-size:13.5px;color:#AAB8D6;font-weight:500;
}
.app-nav-item .ic{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);flex-shrink:0;}
.app-nav-item.active{background:rgba(61,127,255,.18);color:#fff;}
.app-nav-item.active .ic{background:var(--electric);}
.app-main{flex:1;padding:30px 34px;overflow:hidden;}
.app-topbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:26px;}
.app-search{
  flex:1;max-width:360px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;
  padding:9px 14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);
}
.app-top-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;}
.bell{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);position:relative;}
.bell::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:7px;right:7px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--critical);}
.avatar{
  width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--electric),var(--mint));
  color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:13px;font-weight:700;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono';flex-shrink:0;
}
.avatar.lg{width:56px;height:56px;font-size:18px;}
.avatar.xl{width:120px;height:120px;font-size:38px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);}

.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;}
.card-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:14px;}
.grid{display:grid;gap:16px;}
.grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
.grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;}
.grid-4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);}

.badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:100px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;}
.badge.success{background:var(--success-bg);color:var(--success);}
.badge.warning{background:var(--warning-bg);color:var(--warning);}
.badge.critical{background:var(--critical-bg);color:var(--critical);}
.badge.neutral{background:#EEF1F6;color:var(--gray-dark);}
.badge::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor;}

.btn{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:10px;
  font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;font-family:'Inter';cursor:default;
}
.btn-primary{background:var(--electric);color:#fff;}
.btn-ghost{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--navy);}
.btn-mint{background:var(--mint);color:#fff;}

.bar-chart{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:10px;height:120px;}
.bar-chart .bar{flex:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--electric),#8FB4FF);border-radius:6px 6px 2px 2px;position:relative;}
.bar-chart .bar.alt{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--mint),#8CE0D3);}

/* ---------- generic layout helpers ---------- */
.two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:start;}
.big-h{font-size:clamp(36px,4.2vw,58px);font-weight:500;max-width:820px;}
.overview-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:40px;margin-bottom:70px;padding-bottom:60px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
.overview-grid .k{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono';font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--electric);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:600;}
.overview-grid .v{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;font-family:'Fraunces';}

.diagram-node{
  background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 20px;
  font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gray-dark);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
}
.diagram-node .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gray);}

.goal-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px;padding:36px 30px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);}
.goal-card .num{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono';font-size:12px;color:var(--electric);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:22px;}
.goal-card h3{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:12px;}

.research-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:30px;}
.research-card .rn{font-family:'Fraunces';font-size:34px;color:#D7DEEB;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;}
.research-card h4{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:8px;font-family:'Inter';font-weight:700;}
.research-card p{font-size:14px;}

.persona-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:280px 1fr;gap:60px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:22px;padding:50px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);}
.persona-list{margin-top:10px;}
.persona-list li{list-style:none;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--gray-dark);padding:9px 0;padding-left:22px;position:relative;}
.persona-list.goals li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:16px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mint);}
.persona-list.pain li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:16px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#F0B4A8;}

.journey-track{display:flex;gap:0;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:20px;}
.journey-step{min-width:150px;text-align:center;position:relative;padding:0 10px;}
.journey-step .jn{
  width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 14px;
  font-family:'IBM Plex Mono';font-size:13px;font-weight:600;position:relative;z-index:1;
}
.journey-step p{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);}
.journey-line{position:absolute;top:22px;left:50%;width:100%;height:2px;background:var(--border);z-index:0;}
.journey-step:last-child .journey-line{display:none;}

.ia-tree{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono';font-size:14.5px;color:var(--gray-dark);line-height:2.3;}
.ia-tree .root{color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;font-size:16px;}
.ia-tree .child{padding-left:28px;}

.swatch{border-radius:14px;height:104px;position:relative;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);overflow:hidden;}
.swatch .lbl{position:absolute;bottom:10px;left:12px;color:#fff;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono';font-size:11px;}
.swatch.light .lbl{color:#0A1628;}

.type-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:22px 0;}
.type-row .tag{width:90px;flex-shrink:0;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono';font-size:11px;color:var(--gray);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;}

.comp-tile{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;min-height:96px;}
.comp-tile .lbl{font-size:11px;color:var(--gray);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:700;}

.status-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:13.5px;}
.status-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}

.timeline-item{display:flex;gap:20px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
.timeline-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.timeline-dot{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--electric);margin-top:5px;flex-shrink:0;}
.timeline-date{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono';font-size:11.5px;color:var(--gray);width:110px;flex-shrink:0;}

.metric-tile{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:22px;}
.metric-tile .mv{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono';font-size:26px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);}
.metric-tile .ml{font-size:12px;color:var(--gray);margin-top:4px;}
.trend{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;}

.phone-frame{
  width:250px;border-radius:34px;background:var(--navy);padding:10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);flex-shrink:0;
}
.phone-screen{background:#fff;border-radius:26px;overflow:hidden;height:520px;position:relative;}
.phone-notch{position:absolute;top:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:90px;height:22px;background:var(--navy);border-radius:0 0 14px 14px;z-index:2;}

.detail-tile{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:26px;overflow:hidden;}
.detail-tile .tag{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono';font-size:10.5px;color:var(--electric);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:14px;display:block;font-weight:700;}

.footer-cta{text-align:center;padding:180px 40px;}
.footer-cta h2{font-size:clamp(32px,5.5vw,64px);max-width:900px;margin:0 auto 34px;color:#fff;}

::selection{background:var(--electric);color:#fff;}

@media (max-width:900px){
  .section, .section--alt > .inner, .section--dark > .inner{padding:80px 24px;}
  .overview-grid, .grid-4{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
  .grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .two-col, .persona-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px;}
  .app-shell{flex-direction:column;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="progress"></div>

<!-- ============ 01 HERO ============ -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">PRODUCT DESIGN CASE STUDY • 2026</div>
    <h1 class="display">AURA Health</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">AI Healthcare Command Center</div>
    <p class="desc">Designing a smarter clinical workspace that helps healthcare teams understand patients, coordinate care, and act faster with AI-powered insights.</p>
    <div class="hero-tags">
      <span class="hero-tag">Product Designer</span>
      <span class="hero-tag">UI/UX Design</span>
      <span class="hero-tag">AI Experience</span>
      <span class="hero-tag">Healthcare SaaS</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-mockup-wrap">
    <div class="browser-frame" style="max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="browser-bar">
        <span class="browser-dot" style="background:#FF5F57;"></span>
        <span class="browser-dot" style="background:#FEBC2E;"></span>
        <span class="browser-dot" style="background:#28C840;"></span>
        <span class="browser-url">aurahealth.app/dashboard</span>
      </div>
      <div class="app-shell">
        <div class="app-sidebar">
          <div class="app-logo"><span class="dot"></span>AURA</div>
          <div class="app-nav">
            <div class="app-nav-item active"><span class="ic"></span>Dashboard</div>
            <div class="app-nav-item"><span class="ic"></span>Patients</div>
            <div class="app-nav-item"><span class="ic"></span>Appointments</div>
            <div class="app-nav-item"><span class="ic"></span>AI Assistant</div>
            <div class="app-nav-item"><span class="ic"></span>Medical Records</div>
            <div class="app-nav-item"><span class="ic"></span>Lab Results</div>
            <div class="app-nav-item"><span class="ic"></span>Treatment Plans</div>
            <div class="app-nav-item"><span class="ic"></span>Messages</div>
            <div class="app-nav-item"><span class="ic"></span>Analytics</div>
            <div class="app-nav-item" style="margin-top:auto"><span class="ic"></span>Settings</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="app-main">
          <div class="app-topbar">
            <div class="app-search">Search patients, records, insights…</div>
            <div class="app-top-right"><div class="bell"></div><div class="avatar">OB</div></div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-bottom:22px;">
            <div style="font-family:'Fraunces';font-size:24px;font-weight:500;">Good morning, Dr. Bennett</div>
            <p style="font-size:13.5px;margin-top:4px;">You have 8 appointments today and 2 priority AI insights to review.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-4" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
            <div class="metric-tile"><div class="mv">8</div><div class="ml">Today's appointments</div></div>
            <div class="metric-tile"><div class="mv">2</div><div class="ml">Priority insights</div></div>
            <div class="metric-tile"><div class="mv">126</div><div class="ml">Active patients</div></div>
            <div class="metric-tile"><div class="mv">94%</div><div class="ml">Adherence rate</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-2">
            <div class="card">
              <div class="card-title">Recent patients</div>
              <div class="status-row"><span>Olivia Carter</span><span class="badge warning">Review needed</span></div>
              <div class="status-row"><span>Marcus Lee</span><span class="badge success">Stable</span></div>
              <div class="status-row"><span>Priya Nair</span><span class="badge neutral">Follow-up</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <div class="card-title">AI priority insights</div>
              <div class="status-row"><span>Elevated BP trend — O. Carter</span><span class="badge critical">Attention</span></div>
              <div class="status-row"><span>Lab result ready — M. Lee</span><span class="badge neutral">New</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="height:110px;"></div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 02 OVERVIEW ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="overview-grid">
    <div><div class="k">Role</div><div class="v">Product Designer</div></div>
    <div><div class="k">Timeline</div><div class="v">8 Weeks</div></div>
    <div><div class="k">Platform</div><div class="v">Web Application</div></div>
    <div><div class="k">Tools</div><div class="v">Figma • FigJam</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="eyebrow">Overview</div>
  <p class="big-h" style="font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,32px);font-weight:400;">AURA Health is an AI‑powered healthcare command center designed to bring patient information, clinical workflows and intelligent insights into one focused workspace.</p>
</section>

<!-- ============ 03 CHALLENGE ============ -->
<section class="section--alt">
<div class="inner">
  <div class="two-col">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">The Challenge</div>
      <h2 class="big-h">Healthcare data is powerful, but fragmented.</h2>
      <p style="margin-top:26px;max-width:520px;">Healthcare professionals often work across disconnected systems for patient records, appointments, laboratory results, medications and treatment plans — switching context dozens of times a day just to answer one clinical question.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:34px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;">
        <div class="diagram-node"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--critical)"></span>Information overload</div>
        <div class="diagram-node"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--critical)"></span>Fragmented workflows</div>
        <div class="diagram-node"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--critical)"></span>Difficult patient history navigation</div>
        <div class="diagram-node"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--critical)"></span>Documentation burden</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 480 420" style="width:100%;">
        <g font-family="IBM Plex Mono" font-size="11" fill="#4A5568">
          <rect x="10" y="10" width="150" height="46" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#E2E7F0"/>
          <text x="30" y="38">Electronic Records</text>
          <rect x="10" y="90" width="150" height="46" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#E2E7F0"/>
          <text x="30" y="118">Lab Systems</text>
          <rect x="10" y="170" width="150" height="46" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#E2E7F0"/>
          <text x="30" y="198">Scheduling</text>
          <rect x="10" y="250" width="150" height="46" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#E2E7F0"/>
          <text x="30" y="278">Pharmacy Data</text>
          <rect x="10" y="330" width="150" height="46" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#E2E7F0"/>
          <text x="30" y="358">Billing Records</text>
        </g>
        <g stroke="#C6D2E8" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none">
          <path d="M160 33 C 260 33, 260 200, 330 200"/>
          <path d="M160 113 C 260 113, 260 200, 330 200"/>
          <path d="M160 193 C 260 193, 260 200, 330 200"/>
          <path d="M160 273 C 260 273, 260 200, 330 200"/>
